			"notes": "## 0.3.1-beta – Bugfix release (Minecraft 26.3)\n\n**Fixed**\n- **Texture variants**: layers marked `negate` are now handled, and variant IDs written with dashes are recognized. Cosmetics that still drew several variants at once now show only the worn one (e.g. Party Hat, Cyber Wings, Fire Underglow)\n- **Wing brightness**: flat parts like feathers are now equally bright from both sides instead of looking grey from the front\n- **Crouching**: head cosmetics (hats, ears, glasses) no longer float slightly above the head\n\nThe NeoForge 1.21.1 version remains available separately.\n\n*Not affiliated with LabyMod / LabyMedia GmbH.*"
		},
